VALUES
  ('en-ecdict-edb1f42a0bd4ff4b', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'woman', '''wumәn', 'n. 女人, 妇女, 女仆\na. 女用的, 女性的, 妇女的\nvt. 贬称...为女人, 使成女人腔', 'n. an adult female person (as opposed to a man)\nn. a female person who plays a significant role (wife or mistress or girlfriend) in the life of a particular man', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-be6a563e765d0c1d', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'through', 'θru:', 'adv. 穿越, 从头至尾, 到底, 因为\nprep. 经过, 穿过\na. 对穿的, 直达的, 完结的', 's. (of a route or journey etc.) continuing without requiring stops or changes\nr. from beginning to end\nr. over the whole distance\nr. to completion', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-da2b128800d4e129', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'us', 'ʌs', 'pron. 我们\n[经] 美国', 'n North American republic containing 50 states - 48 conterminous states in North America plus Alaska in northwest North America and the Hawaiian Islands in the Pacific Ocean; achieved independence in 1776\nn a base containing nitrogen that is found in RNA (but not in DNA) and derived from pyrimidine; pairs with adenine\nn a heavy toxic silvery-white radioactive metallic element; occurs in many isotopes; used for nuclear fuels and nuclear weapons\nn the 21st letter of the Roman alphabet', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-2b5d05d3594b83ba', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'life', 'laif', 'n. 生活, 生命, 人生, 世事, 生物, 寿命, 一生, 生命力, 灵魂, 无期徒刑\n[医] 生活, 生存, 生命, 寿命', 'n. a characteristic state or mode of living\nn. the experience of being alive; the course of human events and activities\nn. the course of existence of an individual; the actions and events that occur in living\nn. the period during which something is functional (as between birth and death)', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-0e93069c40111cd6', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'child', 'tʃaild', 'n. 孩子, 产物, 追随者\n[医] 儿童', 'n. a young person of either sex\nn. a human offspring (son or daughter) of any age\nn. an immature childish person\nn. a member of a clan or tribe', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-e274eeff768c6396', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'work', 'wә:k', 'n. 工作, 劳动, 职业, 行为, 功, 作品, 成果, 产品, 工程\nvi. 工作, 劳动, 做, 运转, 起作用, 被加工\nvt. 使工作, 使转动, 开动, 使用, 经营, 使逐渐变得, 造成', 'n. activity directed toward making or doing something\nn. a product produced or accomplished through the effort or activity or agency of a person or thing\nn. (physics) a manifestation of energy; the transfer of energy from one physical system to another expressed as the product of a force and the distance through which it moves a body in the direction of that force\nv. exert oneself by doing mental or physical work for a purpose or out of necessity', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-77346d0447daff95', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'down', 'daun', 'a. 向下的\nadv. 下, 下去, 降下\nprep. 往下, 沿着\nn. 丘陵, 软毛, 开阔的高地\n[计] 向下, 退下命令', 'n. soft fine feathers\nn. (American football) a complete play to advance the football\nn. English physician who first described Down''s syndrome (1828-1896)\nn. (usually plural) a rolling treeless highland with little soil', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-f458ef050c0ca014', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'may', 'mei', 'n. 五月\naux. 愿能, 可以, 愿意', 'n. the month following April and preceding June', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-405906c9d5be6ae5', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'after', '''ɑ:ftә', 'prep. 在...之后, 由于\nconj. 在...之后\nadv. 后来', 's. located farther aft\nr. behind or in the rear', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-c6dc9bc9f77b486a', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'should', 'ʃud', 'aux. 应该, 将要', 'imp. of Shall\nimp. Used as an auxiliary verb, to express a conditional or\n contingent act or state, or as a supposition of an actual fact; also,\n to express moral obligation (see Shall); e. g.: they should have come\n last week; if I should go; I should think you could go.', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-bc8d8647b02deea0', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'call', 'kɒ:l', 'n. 呼叫, 访问, 打电话, 号召, 召集, 要求\nvt. 呼叫, 召集, 打电话\nvi. 叫喊, 访问, 叫牌\n[计] 调用; 呼叫; DOS内部命令:在批处理文件中调用另一个批处理文件', 'n. a telephone connection\nn. a special disposition (as if from a divine source) to pursue a particular course\nn. a demand especially in the phrase "the call of duty"\nn. a brief social visit', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-7c211433f0207159', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'world', 'wә:ld', 'n. 世界, 地球, 宇宙, 万物, 世人, 人间, 领域, 世事, 世故, 社会生活, 大量\n[法] 世界, 地球, 世人', 'n. people in general; especially a distinctive group of people with some shared interest\nn. all of your experiences that determine how things appear to you\nn. a part of the earth that can be considered separately\nn. all of the living human inhabitants of the earth', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-f0fed7e493230291', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'over', '''әuvә', 'adv. 结束, 越过, 从头到尾\nprep. 在...之上, 遍于...之上, 越过\na. 上面的\nvt. 越过', 'n. (cricket) the division of play during which six balls are bowled at the batsman by one player from the other team from the same end of the pitch\nr. at or to a point across intervening space etc.\nr. throughout an area\nr. throughout a period of time', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-655f83be7512e5b5', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'school', 'sku:l', 'n. 学校, 鱼群, 门派, 学派\nvt. 教育, 训练, 培养\nvi. 成群地游', 'n. an educational institution\nn. a building where young people receive education\nn. the process of being formally educated at a school\nn. a body of creative artists or writers or thinkers linked by a similar style or by similar teachers', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-677c1bfa3a036c74', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'still', 'stil', 'n. 蒸馏室, 寂静, 剧照\nv. 蒸馏, (使)平静, (使)静止\na. 静止的, 不动的, 静寂的, 不起泡的, 静物摄影的\nadv. 仍然, 更, 静止地\nconj. 然而, 但是', 'n. a static photograph (especially one taken from a movie and used for advertising purposes)\nn. an apparatus used for the distillation of liquids; consists of a vessel in which a substance is vaporized by heat and a condenser where the vapor is condensed\nv. lessen the intensity of or calm\nv. make motionless', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-3240aa0fe3ca1505', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'try', 'trai', 'n. 尝试, 试验, 审理, 审判\nvt. 试, 尝试, 试验, 考验, 审问, 提炼\nvi. 尝试, 试图', 'v. make an effort or attempt\nv. give pain or trouble to\nv. test the limits of\nv. melt (fat or lard) in order to separate out impurities', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-213ed3ea453bf610', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'last', 'lɑ:st', 'a. 最后的, 末尾的, 最近的\nvi. 持续, 支持, 维持\nvt. 使维持, 够...用\nadv. 最后, 后来\nn. 最后, 末尾, 鞋楦头', 'n. the last or lowest in an ordering or series\nn. a person''s dying act; the final thing a person can do\nn. a unit of weight equal to 4,000 pounds\nn. a unit of capacity for grain equal to 80 bushels', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-1c8f09270fc33a39', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'ask', 'ɑ:sk', 'vi. 问, 要求\nvt. 问, 要求, 邀请, 需要', 'v. inquire about\nv. make a request or demand for something to somebody\nv. direct or put; seek an answer to\nv. consider obligatory; request and expect', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-efe30e310694de6b', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'need', 'ni:d', 'n. 需要, 必须, 缺乏\nvt. 需要, 必需\nvi. 贫困, 有必要\naux. 需要', 'n. a condition requiring relief\nn. anything that is necessary but lacking\nv. have or feel a need for', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-164a5c24f5df5918', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'too', 'tu:', 'adv. 也, 非常, 太', 'r to a degree exceeding normal or proper limits\nr in addition', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-ccfcd3664e192e61', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'feel', 'fi:l', 'vt. 感觉, 觉得, 触摸, 以为\nvi. 有知觉, 摸索, 同情\nn. 感觉, 觉得, 触摸', 'n. an intuitive awareness; \nn. manual stimulation of the genital area for sexual pleasure\nv. undergo an emotional sensation or be in a particular state of mind\nv. perceive by a physical sensation, e.g., coming from the skin or muscles', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-aa4a5f8125f23418', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'state', 'steit', 'n. 州, 状态, 情形, 国家, 政府, 领土, 国务, 社会地位\na. 国家的, 正式的, 礼仪用的, 州的\nvt. 说明, 陈述, 规定\n[计] 状态', 'n. the territory occupied by one of the constituent administrative districts of a nation\nn. the way something is with respect to its main attributes\nn. the group of people comprising the government of a sovereign state\nn. a politically organized body of people under a single government', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-85777c03b72554cd', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'never', '''nevә', 'adv. 从不, 决不, 不曾\n[法] 永不, 决不, 从来没有', 'r. not ever; at no time in the past or future\nr. not at all; certainly not; not in any circumstances', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-7bcbf908e034c8e5', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'become', 'bi''kʌm', 'vi. 变成, 变得\nvt. 适合', 'v. enter or assume a certain state or condition\nv. undergo a change or development\nv. come into existence\nv. enhance the appearance of', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-709634051471385a', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'between', 'bi''twi:n', 'prep. 在...之间', 'r. in the interval\nr. in between', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-9235afd3e9880241', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'high', 'hai', 'n. 高度, 高处\na. 高的, 高级的, 主要的, 高尚的, 高原的, 高音的, 昂贵的, 傲慢的\nadv. 高度地, 奢侈地', 'n. a lofty level or position or degree\nn. an air mass of higher than normal pressure\nn. a state of sustained elation\nn. a state of altered consciousness induced by alcohol or narcotics', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-1af17e73721dbe0c', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'something', '''sʌmθiŋ', 'pron. 某事, 某物', 'n. Anything unknown, undetermined, or not specifically\n designated; a certain indefinite thing; an indeterminate or unknown\n event; an unspecified task, work, or thing.\nn. A part; a portion, more or less; an indefinite quantity\n or degree; a little.\nn. A person or thing importance.\nadv. In some degree; somewhat; to some extent; at some\n distance.', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-084ab4093f675b9f', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'really', '''riәli', 'adv. 实际上, 真实地, 实在', 'r in accordance with truth or fact or reality\nr in actual fact\nr in fact (used as intensifiers or sentence modifiers)\nr used as intensifiers; `real'' is sometimes used informally for `really''; `rattling'' is informal', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-d00ef164202a74e3', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'most', 'mәust', 'n. 最多, 最大\na. 大多数的, 几乎全部的, 最多的\nadv. 最, 最多, 极其', 'a. (superlative of `many'' used with count nouns and often preceded by `the'') quantifier meaning the greatest in number\na. the superlative of `much'' that can be used with mass nouns and is usually preceded by `the''; a quantifier meaning the greatest in amount or extent or degree\nr. used to form the superlative\nr. very', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-b7c8ffb8fbc67c17', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'another', 'ә''nʌðә', 'a. 另外的, 再一的, 不同的\npron. 又一个, 另一个, 类似的另一个', 's. any of various alternatives; some other', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-7d3f44729dc24388', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'much', 'mʌtʃ', 'n. 大量, 许多, 重要的事\na. 很多的, 重要的\nadv. 多, 甚, 几乎', 'n. a great amount or extent\na. (quantifier used with mass nouns) great in quantity or degree or extent\nr. to a great degree or extent\nr. very', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-c33f059b0ca7725f', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'family', '''fæmәli', 'n. 家庭, 家人, 族\na. 家庭的', 'n. a social unit living together\nn. primary social group; parents and children\nn. people descended from a common ancestor\nn. (biology) a taxonomic group containing one or more genera', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-fbf63c6adba57ff2', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'own', 'әun', 'n. 自己的\na. 自己的, 嫡亲的, 同胞的\nvt. 拥有, 支配, 自认, 承认, 顺从于\nvi. 承认, 供认', 'v. have ownership or possession of\ns. belonging to or on behalf of a specified person (especially yourself); preceded by a possessive', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-31aed9e37eb93350', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'leave', 'li:v', 'n. 许可, 告别, 请假, 休假\nvt. 离开, 剩下, 遗忘, 委托, 丢弃\nvi. 出发, 离开, 生叶', 'n. the period of time during which you are absent from work or duty\nn. permission to do something\nv. go away from a place\nv. go and leave behind, either intentionally or by neglect or forgetfulness', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-132aeadf736728a3', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'put', 'put', 'vt. 放, 摆, 安置, 移动, 发射, 投掷, 写上, 表达, 使从事, 使受到, 驱使, 赋予\nvi. 出发, 航行, 发芽\nn. 掷, 股票出售权, 笨蛋\na. 固定不动的\n[计] 发送文件', 'v. put into a certain place or abstract location\nv. cause to be in a certain state; cause to be in a certain relation\nv. attribute or give\nv. cause (someone) to undergo something', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-c00dbbc9dadfbe1e', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'old', 'әuld', 'n. 以前, 往昔\na. 老的, 旧的, 古老的, 年长的, 老练的', 'n. past times (especially in the phrase `in days of old'')\na. (used especially of persons) having lived for a relatively long time or attained a specific age\na. of long duration; not new\ns. (used for emphasis) very familiar', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-6517f89c46c3f0d6', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'while', 'hwail', 'n. 一会儿, (一段)时间\nconj. 当...的时候, 虽然\nvt. 消磨', 'n. a period of indeterminate length (usually short) marked by some action or condition', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-5f00f7a0a9f5e57d', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'mean', 'mi:n', 'a. 低劣的, 卑贱的, 简陋的, 吝啬的, 惭愧的, 平均的, 中间的, 普通的\nvt. 意谓, 想要, 意欲, 预定\nvi. 用意, 有意义\nn. 平均数, 中间, 中庸', 'n. an average of n numbers computed by adding some function of the numbers and dividing by some function of n\nv. mean or intend to express or convey\nv. denote or connote\nv. have a specified degree of importance', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-1264bdfe5ff3215c', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'keep', 'ki:p', 'n. 生计, 维持, 保持\nvt. 保持, 保存, 遵守, 看守, 整理, 维持, 履行, 经营, 拘留, 记帐\nvi. 保持, 继续不断', 'n. the main tower within the walls of a medieval castle or fortress\nv. keep in a certain state, position, or activity; e.g., "keep clean"\nv. retain possession of\nv. look after; be the keeper of; have charge of', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-204036a1ef6e7360', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'student', '''stju:dnt', 'n. 学生, 研究者, 学者', 'n. a learner who is enrolled in an educational institution', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
