  ('en-ecdict-02083f4579e08a61', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'body', '''bɒdi', 'n. 身体, 人, 尸体, 主要部分, 团体\nvt. 赋以形体\n[计] 体', 'n. the entire structure of an organism (an animal, plant, or human being)\nn. a group of persons associated by some common tie or occupation and regarded as an entity\nn. a natural object consisting of a dead animal or person\nn. an individual 3-dimensional object that has mass and that is distinguishable from other objects', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
