  ('en-ecdict-0dbe529c4dfad996', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'social', '''sәuʃәl', 'a. 社会的, 群居的, 社交的\nn. 联欢会', 'a. relating to human society and its members\na. living together or enjoying life in communities or organized groups\na. relating to or belonging to or characteristic of high society\ns. composed of sociable people or formed for the purpose of sociability', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-8e73840bbf9c54e8', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'understand', '.ʌndә''stænd', 'vt. 理解, 了解, 领会, 听说, 懂\nvi. 懂得, 认为', 'v. know and comprehend the nature or meaning of\nv. perceive (an idea or situation) mentally\nv. make sense of a language\nv. believe to be the case', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-3b959693d09b2240', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'whether', '''hweðә', 'conj. 是否, 不论\npron. 两个中的哪一个', 'pron. Which (of two); which one (of two); -- used\n interrogatively and relatively.\nconj. In case; if; -- used to introduce the first or two or\n more alternative clauses, the other or others being connected by or, or\n by or whether. When the second of two alternatives is the simple\n negative of the first it is sometimes only indicated by the particle\n not or no after the correlative, and sometimes it is omitted entirely\n as being distinctly implied in the whether of the first.', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-292b0901993f7e9d', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'watch', 'wɒtʃ', 'n. 观察, 手表, 看守, 守护, 监视, 值班人\nvt. 看, 注视, 照顾, 看守, 守护, 监视\nvi. 观看, 注视, 守侯', 'n. a small portable timepiece\nn. a period of time (4 or 2 hours) during which some of a ship''s crew are on duty\nn. a purposeful surveillance to guard or observe\nn. the period during which someone (especially a guard) is on duty', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-9034ff9e2b8f00b4', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'together', 'tә''geðә', 'adv. 一起, 共同, 彼此', 's. mentally and emotionally stable\nr. in contact with each other or in proximity\nr. assembled in one place\nr. in each other''s company', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-f7ac253b1bed9171', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'follow', '''fɒlәu', 'vt. 跟随, 沿行, 遵循, 追求\nvi. 跟随, 接着\nn. 跟随, 追随', 'v. to travel behind, go after, come after\nv. come as a logical consequence; follow logically\nv. travel along a certain course\nv. come after in time, as a result', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-d8fd39d0bbdd2dcf', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'parent', '''perәnt', 'n. 父母, 父母亲, 根源\n[法] 父亲, 母亲, 根源', 'n. a father or mother; one who begets or one who gives birth to or nurtures and raises a child; a relative who plays the role of guardian\nn. an organism (plant or animal) from which younger ones are obtained', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-1b480158e1f30e0b', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'stop', 'stɒp', 'n. 停止, 车站, 逗留, 填塞, 障碍, (风琴的)音栓\nvi. 停止, 被塞住\nvt. 塞住, 堵塞, 阻止, 击落, 停止, 终止, 断绝', 'n. the event of something ending\nn. the act of stopping something\nn. a brief stay in the course of a journey\nn. a spot where something halts or pauses', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-49dc1cb094dffe3a', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'face', 'feis', 'n. 脸, 面容, 正面, 外观\nvt. 面对, 朝, 正视, 面临\nvi. 朝, 向\n[计] 现场可改变的控制元件', 'n. the front of the human head from the forehead to the chin and ear to ear\nn. the general outward appearance of something\nn. the striking or working surface of an implement\nn. a part of a person that is used to refer to a person', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-8867c88b56e0bfb8', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'anything', '''eniθiŋ', 'pron. 任何事', 'n. Any object, act, state, event, or fact whatever; thing of\n any kind; something or other; aught; as, I would not do it for\n anything.\nn. Expressing an indefinite comparison; -- with as or like.\nadv. In any measure; anywise; at all.', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-9b7c68a918b17eb0', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'create', 'kri:''eit', 'vt. 创造, 建造, 引起, 任命', 'v. bring into existence\nv. pursue a creative activity; be engaged in a creative activity\nv. invest with a new title, office, or rank\nv. create by artistic means', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-61c9b2b17db77a27', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'public', '''pʌblik', 'n. 公众, 民众\na. 公众的, 公共的, 公立的, 公用的', 'n. a body of people sharing some common interest\na. not private; open to or concerning the people as a whole\ns. affecting the people or community as a whole', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-e9bc90edb138e8f4', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'already', 'ɒ:l''redi', 'adv. 已经, 早已', 'r. prior to a specified or implied time', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-a65265946e25560c', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'speak', 'spi:k', 'vi. 说, 说话, 演说, 发言\nvt. 说, 讲, 说出', 'v. use language\nv. make a characteristic or natural sound', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-a7afddb68260a60f', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'read', 'ri:d', 'v. 读, 阅读, 理解\na. 有学问的\nn. 读取, 阅读\n[计] 读取', 'n. something that is read\nv. interpret something that is written or printed\nv. have or contain a certain wording or form\nv. look at, interpret, and say out loud something that is written or printed', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-ad60c535ff88e85b', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'level', '''levl', 'n. 水平, 水准, 平地\na. 同高的, 平坦的, 齐平的, 水平的\nvt. 弄平, 夷平, 使同等, 瞄准, 对准\nvi. 变平, 拉平\n[计] 级别', 'n. height above ground\nn. indicator that establishes the horizontal when a bubble is centered in a tube of liquid\nn. an abstract place usually conceived as having depth\nv. aim at', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-6452e7c5a42f97b0', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'allow', 'ә''lau', 'vt. 允许, 同意给予, 承认\nvi. 容许, 猜想\n[计] 允许命令', 'v. let have\nv. give or assign a resource to a particular person or cause\nv. allow or plan for a certain possibility; concede the truth or validity of something\nv. grant as a discount or in exchange', '', '', '', 'licensed');
