  ('en-ecdict-58d1bbce297de3c3', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'add', 'æd', 'vt. 增加, 添加, 附带说明, 计算...总和\nvi. 做加法, 积累而成, 增添\n[计] 加法', 'v. make an addition (to); join or combine or unite with others; increase the quality, quantity, size or scope of\nv. state or say further\nv. make an addition by combining numbers\nv. constitute an addition', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
