  ('en-ecdict-7947e92e3c8e49d8', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'reason', '''ri:zn', 'n. 理由, 原因, 理智, 道理, 前提, 理性\nvt. 说服, 推论, 辩论\nvi. 推论, 劝说, 思考', 'n. a rational motive for a belief or action\nn. an explanation of the cause of some phenomenon\nn. the capacity for rational thought or inference or discrimination\nn. a fact that logically justifies some premise or conclusion', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-36a883e762d4a174', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'low', 'lәu', 'n. 低点, 低价, 低, 牛叫声\na. 低的, 消沉的, 低等的, 浅的, 卑贱的\nadv. 低下地, 谦卑地, 低\nvi. 牛叫', 'n. an air mass of lower pressure; often brings precipitation\nn. British political cartoonist (born in New Zealand) who created the character Colonel Blimp (1891-1963)\nn. a low level or position or degree\na. less than normal in degree or intensity or amount', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-c76ac2e9cd864417', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'win', 'win', 'vt. 赢得, 打胜, 成功\nvi. 获胜, 达到, 影响\nn. 胜利, 赢, 收益', 'n. a victory (as in a race or other competition)\nv. be the winner in a contest or competition; be victorious', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-2c7bf1b777859b71', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'research', 'ri''sә:tʃ', 'n. 研究, 调查, 考察\nvi. 研究, 调查', 'n. systematic investigation to establish facts\nv. attempt to find out in a systematically and scientific manner\nv. inquire into', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-25b732b3425cf842', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'girl', 'gә:l', 'n. 女孩, 少女, 女佣', 'n. a young woman\nn. a friendly informal reference to a grown woman', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-b5cd271b521acc9a', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'guy', 'gai', 'n. 家伙, 支索\nvt. 用支索撑住, 取笑, 嘲弄\nvi. 逃跑', 'n. an informal term for a youth or man\nn. an effigy of Guy Fawkes that is burned on a bonfire on Guy Fawkes Day\nn. a cable, wire, or rope that is used to brace something (especially a tent)\nv. steady or support with a guy wire or cable', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-818743b967a1fdbf', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'early', '''ә:li', 'a. 早的, 早熟的\nadv. 很早, 初', 'a. at or near the beginning of a period of time or course of events or before the usual or expected time\na. being or occurring at an early stage of development\ns. belonging to the distant past\ns. very young', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-39ccb32d95edfdbc', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'food', 'fu:d', 'n. 食物, 养料\n[医] 食物, 食品', 'n. any substance that can be metabolized by an animal to give energy and build tissue\nn. any solid substance (as opposed to liquid) that is used as a source of nourishment\nn. anything that provides mental stimulus for thinking', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-fbd4798165ead7a4', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'himself', 'him''self', 'pron. 他自己, 他亲自', 'pron. An emphasized form of the third person masculine\n pronoun; -- used as a subject usually with he; as, he himself will bear\n the blame; used alone in the predicate, either in the nominative or\n objective case; as, it is himself who saved himself.\npron. One''s true or real character; one''s natural temper and\n disposition; the state of being in one''s right or sane mind (after\n unconsciousness, passion, delirium, or abasement); as, the man has come\n to himself.\npron. pl. Alt. of Himselven', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-b56def36afbfb8cd', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'moment', '''mәumәnt', 'n. 片刻, 瞬间, 重要, 阶段, 力矩\n[医] 片刻, 瞬间, 时机, 因素, 矩', 'n. a particular point in time\nn. an indefinitely short time\nn. a turning force produced by an object acting at a distance (or a measure of that force)\nn. the n-th moment of a distribution is the expected value of the n-th power of the deviations from a fixed value', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-d1d9b9355fa9cd3e', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'air', 'єә', 'n. 空气, 旋律, 态度\nvt. 晾, 使通风, 夸耀', 'n. a mixture of gases (especially oxygen) required for breathing; the stuff that the wind consists of\nn. the region above the ground\nn. a distinctive but intangible quality surrounding a person or thing\nn. once thought to be one of four elements composing the universe (Empedocles)', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-4a82cb6db537ef6c', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'teacher', '''ti:tʃә', 'n. 教师, 老师, 导师', 'n. a person whose occupation is teaching\nn. a personified abstraction that teaches', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-fafec1e5ff94390c', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'force', 'fɒ:s', 'n. 力量, 武力, 势力, 影响力, 军队, 力, 效力\nvt. 强迫, 强夺, 推动, 提高\n[计] 人工转移; 强制', 'n. a powerful effect or influence\nn. (physics) the influence that produces a change in a physical quantity\nn. physical energy or intensity\nn. group of people willing to obey orders', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-98362e3f05e068d9', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'offer', '''ɒfә', 'n. 给予(物), 出价, 提议, 意图, 报价\nvt. 提供, 出价, 奉献, 试图, 使出现, 演出\nvi. 出现, 献祭, 提议, 求婚', 'n. the verbal act of offering\nn. something offered (as a proposal or bid)\nv. make available or accessible, provide or furnish\nv. present for acceptance or rejection', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-8ce77cc3f90c8980', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'enough', 'i''nʌf', 'n. 充足, 够, 很多\na. 充足的, 足够\nadv. 足够\ninterj. 够了', 'n. an adequate quantity; a quantity that is large enough to achieve a purpose\nr. as much as necessary; (`plenty'' is nonstandard) "I''ve had plenty, thanks"', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-24e7451df05ed5cd', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'education', '.edju''keiʃәn', 'n. 教育, 训练, 教育学\n[医] 教育, 训练', 'n. the activities of educating or instructing; activities that impart knowledge or skill\nn. knowledge acquired by learning and instruction\nn. the gradual process of acquiring knowledge\nn. the profession of teaching (especially at a school or college or university)', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-9a82bf01c9b2dcbe', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'across', 'ә''krɒs', 'prep. 越过, 穿过, 与...相交叉, 在...的对面\nadv. 交叉, 到另一边, 在对面, 成十字', 'r. to the opposite side\nr. transversely', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-dea713fc735e960f', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'although', 'ɒ:l''ðou', 'conj. 虽然, 尽管', 'conj. Grant all this; be it that; supposing that;\n notwithstanding; though.', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
