  ('en-ecdict-6dbdd59ab542c91f', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'half', 'hɑ:f', 'n. 一半, 半场, 不完全\na. 一半的, 不完全的, 部分的, 半场的\nadv. 一半地, 部分地, 在某种程度上地, 几乎', 'n. one of two divisions into which some games or performances are divided: the two divisions are separated by an interval\ns. consisting of one of two equivalent parts in value or quantity\ns. partial\na. (of siblings) related through one parent only', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-eea0325f09ff8e01', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'situation', '.sitju''eiʃәn', 'n. 情形, 境遇, 位置\n[医] 情境, 处境', 'n. the general state of things; the combination of circumstances at a given time\nn. a condition or position in which you find yourself\nn. a complex or critical or unusual difficulty', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-861c4f67e887dec8', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'easy', '''i:zi', 'a. 容易的, 缓缓的, 舒适的, 从容的, 宽容的, 流畅的, 随便的, 自在的, 疲软的\nadv. 容易地, 慢慢地', 'a. posing no difficulty; requiring little effort\ns. not hurried or forced\na. free from worry or anxiety\ns. affording pleasure', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-885dc4a9b362094f', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'cost', 'kɒst', 'n. 代价, 价值, 费用\nvi. 花费\nvt. 使失去, 值, 使花费', 'n. the total spent for goods or services including money and time and labor\nv. be priced at\nv. require to lose, suffer, or sacrifice', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-1984337fca8f77eb', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'industry', '''indәstri', 'n. 勤劳, 工业, 企业, 产业, 有组织的劳动\n[经] 工业, 实业', 'n. the people or companies engaged in a particular kind of commercial enterprise\nn. the organized action of making of goods and services for sale', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-f85bdc67e8bb222e', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'figure', '''figә', 'n. 数字, 价格, 图形, 形状\nvt. 描绘, 表示, 演算, 认为\nvi. 计算, 出现, 估计', 'n. a diagram or picture illustrating textual material\nn. a model of a bodily form (especially of a person)\nn. a combination of points and lines and planes that form a visible palpable shape\nn. an amount of money expressed numerically', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-d3a9fb075d49be97', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'street', 'stri:t', 'n. 街道, 马路, 街区\na. 街道的', 'n. a thoroughfare (usually including sidewalks) that is lined with buildings\nn. the part of a thoroughfare between the sidewalks; the part of the thoroughfare on which vehicles travel\nn. the streets of a city viewed as a depressed environment in which there is poverty and crime and prostitution and dereliction\nn. a situation offering opportunities', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-0e76292794888d4f', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'image', '''imidʒ', 'n. 影像, 肖像, 想象, 图像, 形象, 翻版\nvt. 作...的像, 反映, 想象, 象征\nn. 图像\n[计] 图象', 'n. an iconic mental representation\nn. (mathematics) the set of values of the dependent variable for which a function is defined\nn. the general impression that something (a person or organization or product) presents to the public\nv. render visible, as by means of MRI', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-818533aa876aa976', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'itself', 'it''self', 'pron. 它本身, 它自己', 'pron. The neuter reciprocal pronoun of It; as, the thing is\n good in itself; it stands by itself.', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-f6be6ca910984ef0', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'phone', 'fәun', 'n. 电话, 受话器, 耳机\nvt. 打电话给\nvi. 打电话', 'n. (phonetics) an individual sound unit of speech without concern as to whether or not it is a phoneme of some language', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-fa98d8d430693455', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'either', '''i:ðә', 'a. (两者之中)任一的, (两者之中)各一的\npron. (两者之中)任一\nconj. 或, 要么', 'r. after a negative statement used as an intensive meaning something like `likewise'' or `also''', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-a17c9aaa61e80a1b', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'data', '''deitә', 'pl. 资料, 数据\n[计] 数据; DOS内部命令:用于显示或设定系统的日期', 'n. a collection of facts from which conclusions may be drawn', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-a28100fa6a50a3cb', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'cover', '''kʌvә', 'n. 盖子, 封面, 藉口\nvt. 覆盖, 掩饰, 保护, 掩护, 包括\nvi. 覆盖', 'n. the act of concealing the existence of something by obstructing the view of it\nn. fire that makes it difficult for the enemy to fire on your own individuals or formations\nn. a recording of a song that was first recorded or made popular by somebody else\nn. a false identity and background (especially one created for an undercover agent)', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-5898102702f11887', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'quite', 'kwait', 'adv. 相当, 完全, 十分', 'r. to a degree (not used with a negative)\nr. to the greatest extent; completely\nr. of an unusually noticeable or exceptional or remarkable kind (not used with a negative)\nr. actually or truly or to an extreme', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-0e66b49d04a43c19', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'picture', '''piktʃә', 'n. 图画, 照片, 景色, 美丽如画的人(或物), 化身, 生动的描述, 想像, 形象思维\nvt. 画, 拍摄, 用图说明, 描写, 想像\n[计] 图象; 形象; 字形', 'n. a visual representation (of an object or scene or person or abstraction) produced on a surface\nn. a situation treated as an observable object\nn. illustrations used to decorate or explain a text\nn. a typical example of some state or quality', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-168cbb2ea52b9e34', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'clear', 'kliә', 'a. 清楚的, 明确的, 澄清的\nadv. 清晰地\nvt. 澄清, 清除障碍\nvi. 放晴, 变清澈\nn. 空隙\n[计] 清除', 'n. the state of being free of suspicion\nv. make a way or path by removing objects\nv. remove\nv. be debited and credited to the proper bank accounts', '', '', '', 'licensed');
