  ('en-ecdict-8ab6a8a0cf069e37', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'sport', 'spɒ:t', 'n. 运动, 游戏, 娱乐, 消遣, 玩笑\na. 运动的, 户外穿戴的\nvi. 游戏, 参加体育运动, 戏弄, 产生变种\nvt. 炫耀, 使产生变种', 'n. an active diversion requiring physical exertion and competition\nn. the occupation of athletes who compete for pay\nn. (Maine colloquial) a temporary summer resident of Maine\nn. a person known for the way she (or he) behaves when teased or defeated or subjected to trying circumstances', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-9ea5e97d2f481d54', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'board', 'bɒ:d', 'n. 木板, 甲板, 膳食, 会议桌\nvt. 乘船, 供膳食, 用板覆盖\nvi. 搭伙\n[计] 板', 'n. a committee having supervisory powers\nn. a stout length of sawn timber; made in a wide variety of sizes and used for many purposes\nn. a flat piece of material designed for a special purpose\nn. food or meals in general', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-1594b7a4636275b8', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'seek', 'si:k', 'vt. 寻求, 寻找, 探索, 追求, 搜索, 请求\nvi. 寻找, 搜索\n[计] 查找', 'n. the movement of a read/write head to a specific data track on a disk\nv. try to get or reach\nv. go to or towards\nv. inquire for', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-8205aed0c460f4ec', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'per', 'pә:', 'prep. 每一, 通过, 经, 按照\n[经] 每, 按照', 'prep. Through; by means of; through the agency of; by; for; for\n each; as, per annum; per capita, by heads, or according to individuals;\n per curiam, by the court; per se, by itself, of itself. Per is also\n sometimes used with English words.', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-335ce16b3fe40346', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'subject', '''sʌbdʒekt', 'n. 科目, 主题, 臣民, 主语, 题目, (事物的)经受者, 学科, 受治疗者, 原因, 理由\na. 服从的, 易患...的, 隶属的, 受支配的\nadv. 在...条件下\nvt. 使隶属, 使受到\n[计] 主题, 主体', 'n. the subject matter of a conversation or discussion\nn. something (a person or object or scene) selected by an artist or photographer for graphic representation\nn. (grammar) one of the two main constituents of a sentence; the grammatical constituent about which something is predicated\nn. a person who is subjected to experimental or other observational procedures; someone who is an object of investigation', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-f90409b98ffb6142', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'officer', '''ɒfisә', 'n. 军官, 主管, 官员, 公务员\nvt. 指挥', 'n. a person authorized to serve in a position of authority on a vessel\nv. direct or command as an officer', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-e80721793c24ae14', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'private', '''praivit', 'a. 私人的, 秘密的, 私立的, 隐蔽的\nn. 士兵, 隐士, 阴部\n[计] 私人的', 'n. an enlisted man of the lowest rank in the Army or Marines\na. confined to particular persons or groups or providing privacy\ns. concerning things deeply private and personal', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-27ad1672d8c97d74', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'rest', 'rest', 'n. 休息, 睡眠, 安息, 稍息, 静止, 支架, 休息处, 其余者, 剩余部分\nvi. 休息, 睡, 长眠, 安心, 静止, 停止, 安置, 依赖\nvt. 使休息, 使支撑, 把...寄托于', 'n. freedom from activity (work or strain or responsibility)\nn. a state of inaction\nn. euphemisms for death (based on an analogy between lying in a bed and in a tomb)\nn. a support on which things can be put', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-60f59e2b541c1e43', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'deal', 'di:l', 'n. 交易, 协定, 数量, 买卖, 松木板\nvi. 处理, 应付, 做生意\nvt. 分配, 发牌, 给予\n[计] 发牌', 'n. a particular instance of buying or selling\nn. a plank of softwood (fir or pine board)\nn. the type of treatment received (especially as the result of an agreement)\nn. the act of distributing playing cards', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-476ee0f6af1d78aa', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'performance', 'pә''fɒ:mәns', 'n. 施行, 工作情况, 成绩, 行为, 表现, 演出\n[电] 绩效, 性能', 'n. a dramatic or musical entertainment\nn. the act of presenting a play or a piece of music or other entertainment\nn. the act of performing; of doing something successfully; using knowledge as distinguished from merely possessing it\nn. any recognized accomplishment', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-517bd000b74cbc11', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'fight', 'fait', 'n. 打架, 争吵, 斗志\nv. 对抗, 打架', 'n. the act of fighting; any contest or struggle\nn. an intense verbal dispute\nn. a boxing or wrestling match\nv. fight against or resist strongly', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-f793522355b5ef88', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'throw', 'θrәu', 'vt. 投, 掷, 抛, 发射, 摔下, 匆匆穿上(或脱下), 抛弃, 摆脱\nvi. 丢, 掷, 抛\nn. 投掷, 掷骰子, 冒险', 'n. the act of throwing (propelling something with a rapid movement of the arm and wrist)\nn. a single chance or instance\nn. the maximum movement available to a pivoted or reciprocating piece by a cam\nn. bedclothes consisting of a lightweight cloth covering (an afghan or bedspread) that is casually thrown over something', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-af2c7b4ca07ae6c7', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'top', 'tɒp', 'n. 顶部, 顶端, 极点, 上面, 上部, 顶篷, 最高地位, 首位, 陀螺\na. 最高的, 顶上的, 头等的\nvt. 盖, 加以顶, 高达, 超越\nvi. 结束, 达到顶点, 高出\n[计] TOP协议', 'n. the upper part of anything\nn. the highest or uppermost side of anything\nn. the first half of an inning; while the visiting team is at bat\nn. the greatest possible intensity', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-0b35c19a59e785e6', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'quickly', '''kwikli', 'adv. 很快地', 'r. with rapid movements', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-dc52f279269d00dd', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'past', 'pɑ:st', 'n. 过去, 昔时, 往事, 早年经历, 过去时\na. 过去的, 结束的, 卸任的, 过去时的\nprep. 越过, 晚于, 超越, 超出...的可能性(能力、范围等)\npass的过去分词', 'n. the time that has elapsed\nn. a earlier period in someone''s life (especially one that they have reason to keep secret)\nn. a verb tense that expresses actions or states in the past\na. earlier than the present time; no longer current', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-db9a022b75625d56', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'goal', 'gәul', 'n. 目标, 终点, 得分, 球门, 守门员\nvi. 攻门, 射门得分', 'n. the state of affairs that a plan is intended to achieve and that (when achieved) terminates behavior intended to achieve it\nn. game equipment consisting of the place toward which players of a game try to advance a ball or puck in order to score points\nn. a successful attempt at scoring', '', '', '', 'licensed');
