  ('en-ecdict-12c0f1fbadc4046b', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'left', 'left', 'a. 左边的, 左倾的, 左侧的, 左派的\nadv. 在左面\nn. 左, 左面, 左派\nleave的过去式和过去分词', 'n. location near or direction toward the left side; i.e. the side to the north when a person or object faces east\nn. those who support varying degrees of social or political or economic change designed to promote the public welfare\nn. the hand that is on the left side of the body\nn. a turn toward the side of the body that is on the north when the person is facing east', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-bd7580126b941404', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'meeting', '''mi:tiŋ', 'n. 会议, 会面\n[法] 会议, 会谈, 集会', 'n. a formally arranged gathering\nn. a small informal social gathering\nn. a casual or unexpected convergence\nn. the social act of assembling for some common purpose', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-df9d6bd17583fa11', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'determine', 'di''tә:min', 'v. 决定, 决心', 'v. establish after a calculation, investigation, experiment, survey, or study\nv. shape or influence; give direction to\nv. fix conclusively or authoritatively\nv. fix in scope; fix the boundaries of', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-4197eb0cd81150e5', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'prepare', 'pri''pєә', 'vt. 准备, 筹备, 使在思想上有准备, 制造, 调制\nvi. 预备', 'v. to prepare verbally, either for written or spoken delivery\nv. educate for a future role or function\nv. lead up to and soften by sounding the dissonant note in it as a consonant note in the preceding chord', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-4be181e4cac822c0', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'disease', 'di''zi:z', 'n. 疾病, 弊病\n[医] [疾]病', 'n. an impairment of health or a condition of abnormal functioning', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-d869db7fe62fb07c', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'whatever', 'hwɒt''evә', 'pron. 无论什么', 's one or some or every or all without specification', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-53a5687cb26dc41f', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'success', 'sәk''ses', 'n. 成功, 成就, 胜利', 'n. an event that accomplishes its intended purpose\nn. an attainment that is successful\nn. a state of prosperity or fame', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-bf1a4c6597155e9f', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'argue', '''ɑ:gju', 'vi. 提出理由, 争论, 辩论\nvt. 主张, 辩论, 证明, 说服', 'v. present reasons and arguments\nv. have an argument about something\nv. give evidence of', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-3dbcdc08e11750ff', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'recognize', '''rekәgnaiz', 'vt. 认出, 认可, 承认, 公认, 识别, 赏识\nvi. 承认, 具结', 'v. be fully aware or cognizant of\nv. perceive to be the same\nv. exhibit recognition for (an antigen or a substrate)\nv. show approval or appreciation of', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-ad00c690d667f9dc', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'cup', 'kʌp', 'n. 杯子, 茶杯, 优胜杯\nvt. 使成杯状, 为...拔火罐', 'n. a small open container usually used for drinking; usually has a handle\nn. the quantity a cup will hold\nn. any cup-shaped concavity\nn. a United States liquid unit equal to 8 fluid ounces', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-2dc7c1a065e396e8', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'particularly', 'pә''tikjjlәli', 'adv. 特别, 格外, 尤其, 详细地, 细致地', 'r. to a distinctly greater extent or degree than is common\nr. specifically or especially distinguished from others', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-9cb6ff12fb81d5cd', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'amount', 'ә''maunt', 'n. 总数, 总额\nvi. 总计, 等同', 'n. the relative magnitude of something with reference to a criterion\nv. be tantamount or equivalent to', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-083dbabef569d46b', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'ability', 'ә''biliti', 'n. 能力, 才干\n[经] 能力, 才能', 'n. the quality of being able to perform; a quality that permits or facilitates achievement or accomplishment\nn. possession of the qualities (especially mental qualities) required to do something or get something done', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-6ccb4b7c39a6e77f', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'staff', 'stɑ:f', 'n. 全体人员, 工作班子, 棍棒, 杆, 拐杖, 支柱, 权杖\na. 职员的, 雇员的, 参谋的\nvt. 为...配备人员', 'n. personnel who assist their superior in carrying out an assigned task\nn. a strong rod or stick with a specialized utilitarian purpose\nn. the body of teachers and administrators at a school\nn. building material consisting of plaster and hair; used to cover external surfaces of temporary structure (as at an exposition) or for decoration', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-f7edaf3282dafb60', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'indicate', '''indikeit', 'vt. 显示, 象征, 指示, 指出\n[医] 指示', 'v. indicate a place, direction, person, or thing; either spatially or figuratively\nv. to state or express briefly\nv. suggest the necessity of an intervention; in medicine', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-f0db3fa401aea04b', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'character', '''kærәktә', 'n. 个性, 字符, 人物, 性质, 品格, 资格\n[计] 字符', 'n. the inherent complex of attributes that determines a persons moral and ethical actions and reactions\nn. an actor''s portrayal of someone in a play\nn. a person of a specified kind (usually with many eccentricities)\nn. good repute', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-34a7962212abe169', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'growth', 'grәuθ', 'n. 生长, 栽培, 增长\n[计] 等比级数', 'n. (biology) the process of an individual organism growing organically; a purely biological unfolding of events involved in an organism changing gradually from a simple to a more complex level\nn. a progression from simpler to more complex forms\nn. vegetation that has grown\nn. (pathology) an abnormal proliferation of tissue (as in a tumor)', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-c9279f09f8296b9e', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'loss', 'lɒs', 'n. 损失, 遗失, 失败, 输, 错过, 伤亡\n[化] 损失; 损耗', 'n. something that is lost\nn. gradual decline in amount or activity\nn. the act of losing someone or something\nn. the disadvantage that results from losing something', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-7955b936c48c9e75', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'degree', 'di''gri:', 'n. 程度, 度数, 学位, 度\n[医] 度, 程度', 'n. a position on a scale of intensity or amount or quality\nn. a specific identifiable position in a continuum or series or especially in a process\nn. a measure for arcs and angles\nn. the highest power of a term or variable', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-c37424cc626cc035', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'wonder', '''wʌndә', 'n. 奇迹, 惊奇, 惊愕\nvt. 惊奇, 想知道\nvi. 惊讶, 怀疑', 'n. the feeling aroused by something strange and surprising\nn. something that causes feelings of wonder\nv. have a wish or desire to know something\nv. place in doubt or express doubtful speculation', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-a6d81694b1fea544', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'attack', 'ә''tæk', 'n. 攻击, 抨击\nvt. 攻击, 抨击, 动手干\nvi. 攻击', 'n. (military) an offensive against an enemy (using weapons)\nn. an offensive move in a sport or game\nn. the act of attacking\nn. a decisive manner of beginning a musical tone or phrase', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-03558a3d33559f50', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'herself', 'hә:''self', 'pron. 她自己, 她亲自', 'pron. An emphasized form of the third person feminine\n pronoun; -- used as a subject with she; as, she herself will bear the\n blame; also used alone in the predicate, either in the nominative or\n objective case; as, it is herself; she blames herself.\npron. Her own proper, true, or real character; hence, her\n right, or sane, mind; as, the woman was deranged, but she is now\n herself again; she has come to herself.', '', '', '', 'licensed');
