  ('en-ecdict-64875fcccaac069f', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'fish', 'fiʃ', 'n. 鱼, 鱼肉, 鱼类, 接合板\nvt. 钓, 钓鱼, 查出, 用接合板连接\nvi. 捕鱼, 钓鱼, 用钩捞取, 摸索寻找', 'n. any of various mostly cold-blooded aquatic vertebrates usually having scales and breathing through gills\nn. the flesh of fish used as food\nv. seek indirectly\nv. catch or try to catch fish or shellfish', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-8c4a6b36a09cceef', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'particular', 'pә''tikjulә', 'n. 一项(或条、点), 个别项目, 详细说明\na. 特别的, 独有的, 挑剔的, 详尽的', 'n. a fact about some part (as opposed to general)\nn. (logic) a proposition that asserts something about some (but not all) members of a class\ns. unique or specific to a person or thing or category\ns. separate and distinct from others of the same group or category', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
