  ('en-ecdict-fac40e01fef1e0f7', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'suddenly', '''sʌdәnli', 'adv. 突然, 意外, 忽然, 迅速, 即席作成, 即刻, 急速', 'r. happening unexpectedly', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-1eb0b8dc987b82e5', 'en', '英语核心词汇（1–1000）', 'discover', 'dis''kʌvә', 'vt. 发现, 找到, 暴露\nvi. 发现', 'v. make a discovery, make a new finding\nv. make a discovery\nv. see for the first time; make a discovery', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
