  ('en-ecdict-2502deb44ba556ab', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'band', 'bænd', 'n. 带子, 队, 乐队\nv. 联合, 结合\n[计] 频带; 波段; 区', 'n. instrumentalists not including string players\nn. a stripe or stripes of contrasting color\nn. an adornment consisting of a strip of a contrasting color or material\nn. a range of frequencies between two limits', '', '', '', 'licensed');
