  ('en-ecdict-187770cf5af2d346', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'fair', 'fєә', 'n. 展览会, 市集, 美好的事物\na. 公平的, 按规则进行的, 不好不坏的, 晴朗的, 美丽的\nadv. 公平地, 正面地, 有教养地, 清楚地\nvi. 转晴', 'n. gathering of producers to promote business\nn. a competitive exhibition of farm products\nv. join so that the external surfaces blend smoothly\na. free from favoritism or self-interest or bias or deception; conforming with established standards or rules', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-20166cc53d542572', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'pair', 'pєә', 'n. 一双, 一对, 一副\nv. (使)成对', 'n. a set of two similar things considered as a unit\nn. two people considered as a unit\nn. a poker hand with 2 cards of the same value\nv. form a pair or pairs', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-d923de9f69455c8b', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'famous', '''feimәs', 'a. 出名的, 极好的', 's widely known and esteemed', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-eb70d1fcdf826fda', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'exercise', '''eksәsaiz', 'n. 行使, 执行, 运动, 练习, 作业\nvt. 运用, 练习, 运动\nvi. 练习, 锻炼', 'n. the activity of exerting your muscles in various ways to keep fit\nn. systematic training by multiple repetitions\nn. a task performed or problem solved in order to develop skill or understanding\nn. (usually plural) a ceremony that involves processions and speeches', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-d22dda44c8bc2069', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'knee', 'ni:', 'n. 膝, 膝盖\nvt. 膝行, 用膝盖碰', 'n. hinge joint in the human leg connecting the tibia and fibula with the femur and protected in front by the patella\nn. the part of a trouser leg that provides the cloth covering for the knee', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-5a46b8253d07320a', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'flower', '''flauә', 'n. 花, 开花植物, 精华, 盛时\nvi. 开花, 发育, 旺盛, 成熟\nvt. 用花装饰, 使开花', 'n. a plant cultivated for its blooms or blossoms\nn. reproductive organ of angiosperm plants especially one having showy or colorful parts\nn. the period of greatest prosperity or productivity', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-e9b6c75da213460e', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'tape', 'teip', 'n. 带子, 录音带, 磁带, 窄带, 卷尺\nvt. 以带子绑起, 测量, 录音\n[计] 带', 'n. a long thin piece of cloth or paper as used for binding or fastening\nn. a recording made on magnetic tape\nn. the finishing line for a foot race\nn. measuring instrument consisting of a narrow strip (cloth or metal) marked in inches or centimeters and used for measuring lengths', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-c498ae69abf8f584', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'hire', 'haiә', 'n. 租金, 租用, 雇用\nvt. 雇请, 出租\nvi. 受雇', 'n. a newly hired employee\nn. the act of hiring something or someone\nv. engage or hire for work', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-1b7e649fe6adac88', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'familiar', 'fә''miljә', 'a. 熟悉的, 常见的, 亲密的\nn. 熟友, 常客', 'n. a person attached to the household of a high official (as a pope or bishop) who renders service in return for support\nn. a spirit (usually in animal form) that acts as an assistant to a witch or wizard\na. well known or easily recognized\na. within normal everyday experience; common and ordinary; not strange', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-f290fd9a145f9e54', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'appropriate', 'ә''prәupriәt', 'a. 适当的\n[经] 适当的, 拨出, 占用', 'v. take possession of by force, as after an invasion\na. suitable for a particular person or place or condition etc', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-076df7153a50d682', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'supply', 'sә''plai', 'n. 补给, 供给, 供应品\nvt. 补给, 供给, 提供, 补充\nvi. 替代', 'n. an amount of something available for use\nn. offering goods and services for sale\nv. give something useful or necessary to', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-9ec39888780dcfb2', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'fully', '''fuli', 'adv. 十分地, 完全地, 充分地', 'r. to the greatest degree or extent; completely or entirely; (`full'' in this sense is used as a combining form)', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-4ed3655ea94ba490', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'actor', '''æktә', 'n. 男演员, 行动者\n[医] 作用物, 反应物', 'n. a theatrical performer\nn. a person who acts and gets things done', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-e461268b795e9dba', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'birth', 'bә:θ', 'n. 出生, 起源\n[医] 生产, 分娩', 'n. the time when something begins (especially life)\nn. the event of being born\nn. a baby born; an offspring', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-3559d7accf003609', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'search', 'sә:tʃ', 'n. 搜寻, 查究\nv. 搜寻, 搜查, 探求, 调查, 搜索\n[计] 搜索, 路径检索程序', 'n. the activity of looking thoroughly in order to find something or someone\nn. an investigation seeking answers\nn. an operation that determines whether one or more of a set of items has a specified property\nn. the examination of alternative hypotheses', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-d2aac84308e80b4f', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'tie', 'tai', 'n. 带子, 线, 鞋带, 领带, 领结, 关系, 束缚, 平局, 不分胜负\nvt. 系, 打结, 扎, 约束, 与...成平局\nvi. 结合, 打结, 不分胜负', 'n. equality of score in a contest\nn. a horizontal beam used to prevent two other structural members from spreading apart or separating\nn. (music) a slur over two notes of the same pitch; indicates that the note is to be sustained for their combined time value\nn. one of the cross braces that support the rails on a railway track', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-26e8e3d3a68a48f9', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'eastern', '''i:stәn', 'n. 东方人, 东正教徒\na. 东方的, 向东的, 自东的', 's. lying toward or situated in the east\na. of or characteristic of eastern regions of the United States\na. relating to or characteristic of regions of eastern parts of the world', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-e3b7c980d763196e', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'primary', '''praimәri', 'n. 最主要者, 原色\na. 主要的, 初期的, 根本的, 原始的, 首要的, 基本的\n[计] 初等量; 主要的; 一次的', 'n. a preliminary election where delegates or nominees are chosen\nn. one of the main flight feathers projecting along the outer edge of a bird''s wing\nn. (astronomy) a celestial body (especially a star) relative to other objects in orbit around it\na. of first rank or importance or value; direct and immediate rather than secondary', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-1aa96b8f44f6515a', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'yesterday', '''jestәdi', 'n. 昨天\nadv. 昨天', 'n. the day immediately before today\nn. the recent past\nr. on the day preceding today\nr. in the recent past; only a short time ago', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-00b7b8118efde44c', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'circle', '''sә:kl', 'n. 圆周, 社交圈, 循环, 范围\nvt. 围着, 环绕\nvi. 盘旋, 循环', 'n. ellipse in which the two axes are of equal length; a plane curve generated by one point moving at a constant distance from a fixed point\nn. something approximating the shape of a circle\nn. a curved section or tier of seats in a hall or theater or opera house; usually the first tier above the orchestra\nn. any circular or rotating mechanism', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-f3a929b3364b471a', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'device', 'di''vais', 'n. 装置, 设计, 策略, 发明物, 设备\n[计] 设备; DOS内部命令:该命令要求DOS安装一个设备驱动程序', 'n. an instrumentality invented for a particular purpose\nn. something in an artistic work designed to achieve a particular effect\nn. any clever maneuver\nn. any ornamental pattern or design (as in embroidery)', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-5aaf8905f32a43e8', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'progress', '''prәugres', 'n. 进步, 发展, 前进\nvi. 进步, 进行', 'n. the act of moving forward (as toward a goal)\nn. a movement forward\nv. develop in a positive way', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-c03e9099aad17cb5', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'bottom', '''bɒtәm', 'n. 底部\na. 底部的\nvt. 给...装底, 查明真相\nvi. 到达底部, 建立基础', 'n. the lower side of anything\nn. the lowest part of anything\nn. the second half of an inning; while the home team is at bat\nn. a cargo ship', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-7bd1a907a1ec4630', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'island', '''ailәnd', 'n. 岛, 岛屿, 孤立地区, 安全岛\nvt. 使成岛状, 孤立', 'n. a land mass (smaller than a continent) that is surrounded by water\nn. a zone or area resembling an island', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-a3497f3e45b19383', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'exchange', 'iks''tʃeindʒ', 'n. 交换, (电话)交换局, 交换机, 汇兑, 交易所\nv. 交换, 交易, 兑换\n[计] 交换; 电话局', 'n. chemical process in which one atom or ion or group changes places with another\nn. a mutual expression of views (especially an unpleasant one)\nn. the act of changing one thing for another thing\nn. the act of giving something in return for something received', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-6a1cec45eaf37b34', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'clean', 'kli:n', 'a. 干净的, 清白的, 简洁的\nadv. 清洁地, 完全地\nvt. 清理, 使干净, 出空\nvi. 被搞干净\nn. 打扫', 'v. make clean by removing dirt, filth, or unwanted substances from\nv. remove unwanted substances from, such as feathers or pits\nv. be cleanable\nv. deprive wholly of money in a gambling game, robbery, etc.', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-9a12c50f2f23af9f', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'studio', '''stju:diәu', 'n. 工作室, 画室, 演播室, 电影制片厂', 'n. workplace for the teaching or practice of an art\nn. workplace consisting of a room or building where movies or television shows or radio programs are produced and recorded', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-52d3663e7b672f0e', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'county', '''kaunti', 'n. 县, 郡', 'n. (United Kingdom) a region created by territorial division for the purpose of local government\nn. (United States) the largest administrative district within a state', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-94efdd6f628eda9c', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'train', 'trein', 'n. 火车, 列车, 行列, 长队, 一连串的后果, 顺序\nvt. 训练, 教育, 对准\nvi. 受训练, 锻炼', 'n. public transport provided by a line of railway cars coupled together and drawn by a locomotive\nn. a series of consequences wrought by an event\nn. piece of cloth forming the long back section of a gown that is drawn along the floor\nv. create by training and teaching', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-5c05775c9d03cfa3', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'lady', '''leidi', 'n. 淑女, 夫人, 女士, 贵妇', 'n. a polite name for any woman\nn. a woman of the peerage in Britain', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-ace6752be4cc2485', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'colleague', '''kɒli:g', 'n. 同事, 同僚', 'n. an associate that one works with\nn. a person who is member of one''s class or profession', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-d2005cc206ccbfde', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'application', '.æpli''keiʃәn', 'n. 应用, 申请, 志愿书, 应用程序\n[计] 应用, 应用程序', 'n. the act of bringing something to bear; using it for a particular purpose\nn. a verbal or written request for assistance or employment or admission to a school\nn. the work of applying something; \nn. a program that gives a computer instructions that provide the user with tools to accomplish a task', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-8be47d2b8549b583', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'lean', 'li:n', 'n. 瘦肉, 倾斜, 倾斜度\na. 瘦的, 贫乏的, 歉收的\nvi. 倚靠, 倾斜, 依赖\nvt. 使倾斜', 'v. to incline or bend from a vertical position\nv. cause to lean or incline\nv. rely on for support\na. lacking in mineral content or combustible material', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-bb4a91749fe02cfa', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'neck', 'nek', 'n. 脖子, 衣领, 颈\nvi. 拥抱, 拥吻, 收缩\nvt. 割颈', 'n. the part of an organism (human or animal) that connects the head to the rest of the body\nn. a narrow elongated projecting strip of land\nn. a cut of meat from the neck of an animal\nn. a narrow part of an artifact that resembles a neck in position or form', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-54198309009a3741', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'damage', '''dæmidʒ', 'n. 损害, 伤害\nv. 损害', 'n. the occurrence of a change for the worse\nn. loss of military equipment\nn. the act of damaging something or someone\nv. inflict damage upon', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-141a29d54db6d1d3', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'plastic', '''plæstik', 'n. 塑料, 可塑体, 可塑性物质\na. 塑料的, 塑造的, 有可塑性的, 造型的, 易受影响的, 有创造力的', 'n. generic name for certain synthetic or semisynthetic materials that can be molded or extruded into objects or films or filaments or used for making e.g. coatings and adhesives\ns. capable of being influenced or formed', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-09649207a9b5da67', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'tall', 'tɒ:l', 'a. 高的, 长的, 夸大的\nadv. 夸大地', 'n. a garment size for a tall person\na. great in vertical dimension; high in stature\ns. impressively difficult', '', '', '', 'licensed');
