VALUES
  ('en-ecdict-9012c45d7bd54d45', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'plate', 'pleit', 'n. 碟, 盘子, 盆中物, 金属板, 图版, 金银餐具, 印版, 金属牌(照)\nvt. 镀金, 电镀, 用金属板固定, 给...装钢板, 为...制印版', 'n. a sheet of metal or wood or glass or plastic\nn. a full-page illustration (usually on slick paper)\nn. dish on which food is served or from which food is eaten\nn. the quantity contained in a plate', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-c3ace180d336809b', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'hate', 'heit', 'n. 憎恨, 恨, 厌恶\nvt. 憎恨, 憎恶\nvi. 仇恨', 'n. the emotion of intense dislike; a feeling of dislike so strong that it demands action\nv. dislike intensely; feel antipathy or aversion towards', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-80427506b996b7ac', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'otherwise', '''ʌðәwaiz', 'adv. 否则, 不同地, 别的方式', 's. other than as supposed or expected\nr. in other respects or ways', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-1935d7b6e1cdaa0c', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'writing', '''raitiŋ', 'n. 书写, 著作, 笔迹, 作品\n[医] 书写', 'n. the act of creating written works\nn. the work of a writer; anything expressed in letters of the alphabet (especially when considered from the point of view of style and effect)\nn. (usually plural) the collected work of an author\nn. letters or symbols that are written or imprinted on a surface to represent the sounds or words of a language', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-030ef4a52619b493', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'male', 'meil', 'n. 男人, 雄性动物\na. 男性的, 雄性的, 有力的', 'n. an animal that produces gametes (spermatozoa) that can fertilize female gametes (ova)\nn. a person who belongs to the sex that cannot have babies\nn. the capital of Maldives in the center of the islands\na. being the sex (of plant or animal) that produces gametes (spermatozoa) that perform the fertilizing function in generation', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-006e1d4a9aa6b4eb', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'alive', 'ә''laiv', 'a. 活着的, 活泼的, 敏感的, 热闹的', 'a. possessing life\ns. (often followed by `with'') full of life and spirit\ns. (followed by `to'' or `of'') aware of\ns. capable of erupting', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-ec9814396ba26fa0', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'expression', 'ik''spreʃәn', 'n. 表达, 表现, 词语, 措辞\n[计] 表达式', 'n. the feelings expressed on a person''s face\nn. expression without words\nn. the communication (in speech or writing) of your beliefs or opinions\nn. (genetics) the process of expressing a gene', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-2d27b62c597ec858', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'football', '''futbɒ:l', 'n. 足球, 橄榄球', 'n. any of various games played with a ball (round or oval) in which two teams try to kick or carry or propel the ball into each other''s goal\nn. the inflated oblong ball used in playing American football', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-f72c7b772a8f432e', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'intend', 'in''tend', 'vt. 计划, 打算, 意思是\n[法] 想要, 打算, 意旨', 'v. have in mind as a purpose\nv. design or destine', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-cef7e59218e3a7e1', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'chicken', '''tʃikin', 'n. 小鸡, 鸡肉', 'n. the flesh of a chicken used for food\nn. a domestic fowl bred for flesh or eggs; believed to have been developed from the red jungle fowl\nn. a foolhardy competition; a dangerous activity that is continued until one competitor becomes afraid and stops\ns. easily frightened', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-0b50dd7e1b37dc26', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'army', '''ɑ:mi', 'n. 军队, 陆军', 'n. a permanent organization of the military land forces of a nation or state\nn. a large number of people united for some specific purpose', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-39ca1c87e425d186', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'abuse', 'ә''bju:s.ә''bju:z', 'n. 滥用, 虐待, 恶习, 辱骂\nvt. 滥用, 辱骂, 虐待', 'n. a rude expression intended to offend or hurt\nv. use foul or abusive language towards\nv. use wrongly or improperly or excessively', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-e9683b50d456b492', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'shut', 'ʃʌʃ', 'n. 关闭\nvt. 关上, 闭起, 幽禁, 合拢, 轧住\nvi. 关上, 停止营业', 'a. not open', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-37745ed7a0f005fb', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'map', 'mæp', 'n. 地图, 天体图, 映像\nvt. 映射, 绘制...地图, 计划\n[计] 实用程序, 映射, 制造自动化协议', 'n. a diagrammatic representation of the earth''s surface (or part of it)\nv. make a map of; show or establish the features of details of\nv. explore or survey for the purpose of making a map\nv. locate within a specific region of a chromosome in relation to known DNA or gene sequences', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
