  ('en-ecdict-0be1787af05c64b6', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'organize', '''ɒ:gәnaiz', 'vt. 组织, 有机化, 给予生机\nvi. 组织起来', 'v. cause to be structured or ordered or operating according to some principle or idea\nv. bring order and organization to\nv. arrange by systematic planning and united effort', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
