  ('en-ecdict-caee3e9d54b49ae5', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'novel', '''nɒvl', 'n. 小说, 长篇故事\na. 新奇的, 异常的', 'n. an extended fictional work in prose; usually in the form of a story\nn. a printed and bound book that is an extended work of fiction\ns. pleasantly new or different', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
