  ('en-ecdict-6ad3a9478f1c4162', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'storm', 'stɒ:m', 'n. 暴风雨, 骚动, 风波, 风暴, 猛攻\nvi. 起风, 猛冲, 怒吼\nvt. 猛攻', 'n. a violent weather condition with winds 64-72 knots (11 on the Beaufort scale) and precipitation and thunder and lightning\nn. a violent commotion or disturbance\nn. a direct and violent assault on a stronghold\nv. take by force', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
