  ('en-ecdict-68d16beb94cea3bb', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'ultimately', '''ʌltimәtli', 'adv. 最后, 最终\n[法] 最后, 终究, 总之', 'r. as the end result of a succession or process', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-9d989e8d27dc9e0e', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'cat', 'kæt', 'n. 猫, 恶妇\nvi. 呕吐\n计算机辅助教育, 计算机辅助测试, 计算机辅助翻译, 计算机辅助排版\n[计] 计算机辅助教学, 计算机辅助翻译, 计算机辅助排字, 计算机辅助测试', 'n. feline mammal usually having thick soft fur and no ability to roar: domestic cats; wildcats\nn. a spiteful woman gossip\nv. beat with a cat-o''-nine-tails', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-6a411c76198079fd', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'contribution', '.kɒntri''bju:ʃәn', 'n. 捐助, 捐助之物, 贡献\n[经] 贡献, 捐款, 补助品', 'n. the part played by a person in bringing about a result\nn. a voluntary gift (as of money or service or ideas) made to some worthwhile cause\nn. act of giving in common with others for a common purpose especially to a charity\nn. an amount of money contributed', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-7cb1f56d3fbe09e8', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'capacity', 'kә''pæsiti', 'n. 容量, 能力, 才能, 资格\n[计] 容量', 'n. capability to perform or produce\nn. the amount that can be contained\nn. the maximum production possible\nn. a specified function', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-2528fc8471df507a', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'estate', 'i''steit', 'n. 不动产, (人生的)阶段, 阶层, 财产\n[经] 房地产, 遗产, 财产', 'n. everything you own; all of your assets (whether real property or personal property) and liabilities\nn. extensive landed property (especially in the country) retained by the owner for his own use', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
