  ('en-ecdict-4ebd24dfcee2a933', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'manner', '''mænә', 'n. 样子, 礼貌, 风格\n[法] 方式, 方法, 样式', 'n. how something is done or how it happens\nn. a way of acting or behaving\nn. a kind', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-ca456ebf8e01e11c', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'silence', '''sailәns', 'n. 沉默, 无声, 静寂, 湮没, 无声息\nvt. 使缄默\ninterj. 安静', 'n. the state of being silent (as when no one is speaking)\nn. the absence of sound\nv. keep from expression, for example by threats or pressure', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
