  ('en-ecdict-42dc7e4f3f947f5d', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'Conservative', 'kәn''sә:vәtiv', 'a. 保守的, 守旧的, 有保存力的\n[化] 防腐剂; 保存剂', 'n. a person who is reluctant to accept changes and new ideas\nn. a member of a Conservative Party\na. resistant to change\ns. having social or political views favoring conservatism', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
