  ('en-ecdict-d09675fce8a0f318', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'industrial', 'in''dʌstriәl', 'a. 工业的, 供工业用的, 工业高度发展的, 产业的\nn. 工业工人, 工业股票', 'a. of or relating to or resulting from industry\na. having highly developed industries\ns. employed in industry\ns. suitable to stand up to hard wear', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
