  ('en-ecdict-36ab4aaa56c8fea2', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'signal', '''signl', 'n. 信号, 暗号, 近因, 导火线\nvt. 向...作信号, 标志, 用信号通知\nvi. 发信号\na. 作为信号的, 显著的\n[计] 信号', 'n. any nonverbal action or gesture that encodes a message\nn. any incitement to action\nn. an electric quantity (voltage or current or field strength) whose modulation represents coded information about the source from which it comes\ns. notably out of the ordinary', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-481902ec14eaf3fc', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'king', 'kiŋ', 'n. 国王, 君主\nvt. 使...成为君主\nvi. 君临, 统治', 'n. a male sovereign; ruler of a kingdom\nn. a competitor who holds a preeminent position\nn. preeminence in a particular category or group or field\nn. United States woman tennis player (born in 1943)', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-55fc4ba84b48423d', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'passenger', '''pæsindʒә', 'n. 乘客, 旅客\n[经] 乘客, 旅客', 'n. a traveler riding in a vehicle (a boat or bus or car or plane or train etc) who is not operating it', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-9e8a01f258ee6093', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'assistance', 'ә''sistәns', 'n. 协助, 援助\n[经] 援助, 帮助', 'n the activity of contributing to the fulfillment of a need or furtherance of an effort or purpose\nn a resource', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-e07f8c4ab6822127', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'forever', 'fә''revә', 'adv. 永远', 'r. for a very long or seemingly endless time', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-b45834556ffc3b54', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'regard', 'ri''gɑ:d', 'n. 关心, 注意, 尊敬, 关系, 问候\nvt. 视为, 注意, 考虑, 和...有关, 看待\nvi. 注视, 注意', 'n. (usually plural) a polite expression of desire for someone''s welfare\nn. a feeling of friendship and esteem\nv. look at attentively', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-03c065bae9f5b4e2', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'knock', 'nɒk', 'n. 敲, 敲打, 敲门\nv. 敲击, 互撞, 攻击', 'n. the sound of knocking (as on a door or in an engine or bearing)\nn. negative criticism\nn. a vigorous blow\nn. a bad experience', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-f0cad97953dfb126', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'wrap', 'ræp', 'n. 外套, 围巾, 包裹物, 限制, 约束, 秘密, 换行\nvt. 包装, 卷, 缠绕, 包, 裹, 覆盖, 遮蔽, 隐藏, 掩护\nvi. 缠绕, 穿外衣, 包起来\n[计] 换行', 'n. cloak that is folded or wrapped around a person\nn. a sandwich in which the filling is rolled up in a soft tortilla\nv. arrange or fold as a cover or protection\nv. crash into so as to coil around', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-59b189070af751d4', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'display', 'dis''plei', 'n. 显示, 陈列, 炫耀, 显示器\nvt. 陈列, 显示, 表现, 夸示\n[计] 显示器; 显示', 'n. something intended to communicate a particular impression\nn. something shown to the public\nn. a visual representation of something\nn. behavior that makes your feelings public', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-2b5d72ee84c83332', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'criticism', '''kritisizm', 'n. 批评, 评论, 非难\n[法] 批判, 批评, 评论', 'n. disapproval expressed by pointing out faults or shortcomings\nn. a serious examination and judgment of something\nn. a written evaluation of a work of literature', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-5b742e15a1a2c32d', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'spiritual', '''spiritʃuәl', 'a. 精神上的, 神圣的, 崇高的, 高尚的, 鬼的, 招魂术的\nn. 有关教会的事', 'n. a kind of religious song originated by Blacks in the southern United States\ns. concerned with or affecting the spirit or soul\ns. lacking material body or form or substance', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-fe0feb3c23600a3f', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'musical', '''mju:zikl', 'n. 音乐片, 音乐舞台剧\na. 音乐的, 声音美妙的, 喜爱音乐的', 'n. a play or film whose action and dialogue is interspersed with singing and dancing\na. characterized by or capable of producing music\na. talented in or devoted to music\na. characteristic of or resembling or accompanied by music', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-12df55dfe072a7f0', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'prayer', 'prєә. ''preiә', 'n. 祈祷, 恳求, 祷辞, 祈祷者', 'n. the act of communicating with a deity (especially as a petition or in adoration or contrition or thanksgiving)\nn. reverent petition to a deity\nn. a fixed text used in praying\nn. someone who prays to God', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
