  ('en-ecdict-f3f1dd33eb2a8b38', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'definition', '.defi''niʃәn', 'n. 定义, 精确度, 清晰度\n[计] 清晰度; 清晰度', 'n. a concise explanation of the meaning of a word or phrase or symbol\nn. clarity of outline', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
