  ('en-ecdict-8065c9467260692f', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'excellent', '''ekslәnt', 'a. 优良的, 杰出的, 出色的', 's. very good; of the highest quality', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
