  ('en-ecdict-00299a408dc3498a', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'library', '''laibrәri', 'n. 图书馆, 藏书, 库\n[计] 库', 'n. a room where books are kept\nn. a collection of literary documents or records kept for reference or borrowing\nn. a depository built to contain books and other materials for reading and study\nn. (computing) a collection of standard programs and subroutines that are stored and available for immediate use', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
