  ('en-ecdict-5450f3b34e6760cd', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'arrest', 'ә''rest', 'n. 逮捕, 监禁\nvt. 拘捕, 抑制, 吸引, 阻止', 'n. the state of inactivity following an interruption', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-6814a21e90f4f5d5', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'wash', 'wɒʃ', 'n. 洗, 洗涤, 冲洗, 洗的衣服, 冲积物, 洼地\nvt. 洗, 洗涤, 洗清, 用水冲洗, 流过, 弄湿, 粉刷, 镀金属薄层于\nvi. 洗涤, 洗澡, 被冲蚀, 漂浮', 'n. a thin coat of water-base paint\nn. the work of cleansing (usually with soap and water)\nn. the dry bed of an intermittent stream (as at the bottom of a canyon)\nn. a watercolor made by applying a series of monochrome washes one over the other', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-11e9ba26c91a2db7', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'schedule', '''skedʒuәl', 'n. 时间表, 一览表, 计划表, 议事日程\nvt. 预定, 编制目录, 制...表, 安排', 'n. an ordered list of times at which things are planned to occur\nv. plan for an activity or event\nv. make a schedule; plan the time and place for events', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
