  ('en-ecdict-6d0d5876e6710ebb', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'print', 'print', 'n. 打印, 版, 印刷物, 痕迹, 印刷业, 印刷字体, 图片, 印花布, 印章\nv. 打印, 印刷, 铭记, 留印记于, 用印刷体写\n[计] DOS外部命令:在打印机上打印文件, 可一边打印文件一边执行其他工作', 'n. the text appearing in a book, newspaper, or other printed publication\nn. a picture or design printed from an engraving\nn. availability in printed form\nn. a copy of a movie on film (especially a particular version of it)', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
