  ('en-ecdict-da9dc2f54bcc987b', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'joint', 'dʒɒint', 'n. 连接处, 接合, 关节\na. 共同的, 联合的, 连接的, 合办的\nvt. 连接, 接合, 使有接头\nvi. 贴合, 长节', 'n. (anatomy) the point of connection between two bones or elements of a skeleton (especially if it allows motion)\nn. a disreputable place of entertainment\nn. junction by which parts or objects are joined together\nn. marijuana leaves rolled into a cigarette for smoking', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-a5dfd1e2a15413c2', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'reply', 'ri''plai', 'n. 答复, 回答, 答辩\nvi. 答复, 回答, 回击, 反响, 答辩\nvt. 回答\n[计] 答复', 'n. the speech act of continuing a conversational exchange', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
