  ('en-ecdict-4f197c99a78b8411', 'en', '英语进阶词汇（1001–2000）', 'pop', 'pɒp', 'n. 砰然声, 枪击, 含气饮料, 流行音乐, 通俗艺术\na. 流行的, 热门的, 通俗的\nvt. 使发出爆裂声, 开枪打, 突然伸出\nvi. 发出爆裂声, 射击, 突然出现, 瞪大\nadv. 突然, 砰地\n[计] 出现点, 邮局协议', 'n. a sweet drink containing carbonated water and flavoring\nn. a sharp explosive sound as from a gunshot or drawing a cork\nv. hit a pop-fly\nv. make a sharp explosive noise', '', '', '', 'licensed');
