  ('en-ecdict-b9c7b42de27fde88', 'en', '英语扩展词汇（2001–3000）', 'flat', 'flæt', 'a. 平坦的, 单调的, 无力的, 浅的, 萧条的, 干脆的, 无聊的\nadv. 平直地, 断然地\nn. 扁平物, 平面, 平地, 平原, 平板车\nv. (使)变平', 'n. a level tract of land\nn. a shallow box in which seedlings are started\nn. a musical notation indicating one half step lower than the note named\nn. a deflated pneumatic tire', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-63acf68c4f951d64', 'en', '英语扩展词汇（2001–3000）', 'brand', 'brænd', 'n. 商标, 牌子, 烙印\nvt. 打烙印于', 'n. a recognizable kind\nn. identification mark on skin, made by burning\nn. a piece of wood that has been burned or is burning\nv. burn with a branding iron to indicate ownership; of animals', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-a90bcd21b4f72781', 'en', '英语扩展词汇（2001–3000）', 'assure', 'ә''ʃuә', 'vt. 保证, 使确信, 弄清楚, 担保\n[法] 确信, 保证, 保障', 'v. inform positively and with certainty and confidence\nv. assure somebody of the truth of something with the intention of giving the listener confidence', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-1b3cccda27f8c7a6', 'en', '英语扩展词汇（2001–3000）', 'mad', 'mæd', 'a. 疯狂的, 发疯的, 生气的, 愚蠢的, 狂欢的\nn. 狂怒', 's roused to anger\ns affected with madness or insanity\ns marked by uncontrolled excitement or emotion\ns very foolish', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-ba19cc7b2184cd3c', 'en', '英语扩展词汇（2001–3000）', 'award', 'ә''wɒ:d', 'n. 奖品, 裁定, 判决\nvt. 授予, 给予', 'n. a grant made by a law court\nn. a tangible symbol signifying approval or distinction\nv. give, especially as an honor or reward\nv. give as judged due or on the basis of merit', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-a19e070e30616772', 'en', '英语扩展词汇（2001–3000）', 'via', 'vaiә', 'prep. 经由, 经过, 通过\n[医] 病毒灭活剂', 'n. A road way.\nprep. By the way of; as, to send a letter via Queenstown to\n London.', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-77c3cf9ba4744381', 'en', '英语扩展词汇（2001–3000）', 'precisely', 'pri''saisli', 'adv. 精确地, 明确地, 刻板地, 拘泥地, 正好, 恰恰, 对, 正是如此, 确实如此, 不错', 'r. indicating exactness or preciseness\nr. in a precise manner\nr. just as it should be', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
