  ('en-ecdict-60f7a51208a50e46', 'en', '英语扩展词汇（2001–3000）', 'odd', 'ɒd', 'a. 奇数的, 古怪的, 剩余的, 零散的, 各种各样的, 少量的\nn. 奇特的事物, 怪人\n[计] 奇数, 奇校验, 光数据数字转换器', 'a. not divisible by two\ns. not easily explained\ns. an indefinite quantity more than that specified\ns. of the remaining member of a pair, of socks e.g.', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
