  ('en-ecdict-29324637de6f924f', 'en', '英语扩展词汇（2001–3000）', 'exciting', 'ik''saitiŋ', 'a. 令人兴奋的, 刺激的\n[电] 激磁', 'a. creating or arousing excitement\ns. stimulating interest and discussion', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
