  ('en-ecdict-eb212bb2faeeaf8f', 'en', '英语扩展词汇（2001–3000）', 'pile', 'pail', 'n. 堆, 大堆, 大厦, 建筑群, 电池, 大量, 桥桩, 软毛, 痔疮\nvi. 堆起, 堆积, 积累, 挤, 猛烈攻击\nvt. 堆于, 累积, 堆叠, 打桩于, 用桩支撑', 'n. a collection of objects laid on top of each other\nn. a large sum of money (especially as pay or profit)\nn. a column of wood or steel or concrete that is driven into the ground to provide support for a structure\nn. the yarn (as in a rug or velvet or corduroy) that stands up from the weave', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
