  ('en-ecdict-922cce49ed1675a8', 'en', '英语扩展词汇（2001–3000）', 'yours', 'juәz', 'pron. 你的(东西), 你们的(东西)', 'pron. See the Note under Your.', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-5bfb7116984db7b5', 'en', '英语扩展词汇（2001–3000）', 'pitch', 'pitʃ', 'n. 程度, 坡度, 顶点, 前倾, 倾斜, 投掷, 音高, 螺距, 节距, 摊位, 树脂, 沥青\nvt. 投, 掷, 向前倾跌, 扎营, 竭力推销, 为...定调, 定位于, 用沥青涂\nvi. 搭帐篷, 投掷, 向前跌, 猛然摔倒, 坠落, 倾斜\n[计] 孔距', 'n. the property of sound that varies with variation in the frequency of vibration\nn. (baseball) the act of throwing a baseball by a pitcher to a batter\nn. a vendor''s position (especially on the sidewalk)\nn. degree of deviation from a horizontal plane', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-2f2aa30f352457a7', 'en', '英语扩展词汇（2001–3000）', 'brilliant', '''briljәnt', 'a. 光辉的, 灿烂的, 有才气的\n[机] 亮的', 's. of surpassing excellence\ns. characterized by grandeur\ns. full of light; shining intensely', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-001f63800ae37c35', 'en', '英语扩展词汇（2001–3000）', 'manufacturing', '.mænju''fæktʃәriŋ', 'n. 制造业\na. 制造业的', 'n the act of making something (a product) from raw materials\nv put together out of artificial or natural components or parts; He manufactured a popular cereal"\nv make up something artificial or untrue\nv produce naturally\nv create or produce in a mechanical way', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-da4dbfbc4fdc5623', 'en', '英语扩展词汇（2001–3000）', 'absolute', '''æbsәlu:t', 'a. 绝对的, 专制的, 完全的, 独立的\nn. 绝对事物', 'n. something that is conceived or that exists independently and not in relation to other things; something that does not depend on anything else and is beyond human control; something that is not relative\na. perfect or complete or pure\ns. complete and without restriction or qualification; sometimes used informally as intensifiers\ns. not limited by law', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-4a23e49d7d45e73f', 'en', '英语扩展词汇（2001–3000）', 'offensive', 'ә''fensiv', 'a. 令人不快的, 侮辱的, 攻击性的\n[法] 攻击的, 进攻的, 冒犯的', 's. violating or tending to violate or offend against\na. for the purpose of attack rather than defense\na. causing anger or annoyance\na. unpleasant or disgusting especially to the senses', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-1b2a623b2b2169fb', 'en', '英语扩展词汇（2001–3000）', 'appoint', 'ә''pɒint', 'vt. 任命, 指定, 下令\n[法] 派, 派任, 任命', 'v. create and charge with a task or function\nv. assign a duty, responsibility or obligation to\nv. furnish', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-13a2828b3adecc1c', 'en', '英语扩展词汇（2001–3000）', 'register', '''redʒistә', 'n. 寄存器, 记录, 登记簿, 注册\nvt. 记录, 注册, 提示, 表达, 把...挂号\nvi. 登记, 注册, 挂号\n[计] 寄存器', 'n. an official written record of names or events or transactions\nn. (music) the timbre that is characteristic of a certain range and manner of production of the human voice or of different pipe organ stops or of different musical instruments\nn. a book in which names and transactions are listed\nn. (computer science) memory device that is the part of computer memory that has a specific address and that is used to hold information of a specific kind', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-85193e237d55185f', 'en', '英语扩展词汇（2001–3000）', 'successfully', 'sәk''sesfjli', 'adv. 成功, 结果良好, 有成就', 'r. with success; in a successful manner', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-dfdd7bce2ad9f89d', 'en', '英语扩展词汇（2001–3000）', 'lemon', '''lemәn', 'n. 柠檬, 柠檬树, 柠檬色\n[医] 柠檬', 'n. yellow oval fruit with juicy acidic flesh\nn. a small evergreen tree that originated in Asia but is widely cultivated for its fruit\nn. a distinctive tart flavor characteristic of lemons\nn. an artifact (especially an automobile) that is defective or unsatisfactory', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-eff2146bfbc05835', 'en', '英语扩展词汇（2001–3000）', 'hungry', '''hʌŋgi', 'a. 饥饿的, 荒年的, 渴望的, 不毛的\n[化] 欠鞣皮', 'a. feeling hunger; feeling a need or desire to eat food', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-325d4882dbd211f6', 'en', '英语扩展词汇（2001–3000）', 'wander', '''wɒndә', 'vi. 游荡, 漫步, 徘徊, 迷路, 离题, 蜿蜒\nvt. 在...漫游', 'v. go via an indirect route or at no set pace', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-842df0e20f514400', 'en', '英语扩展词汇（2001–3000）', 'naked', '''neikid', 'a. 裸体的, 无装饰的, 无保护的, 赤贫的\n[医] 裸露的', 's. having no protecting or concealing cover\ns. (of the eye or ear e.g.) without the aid of an optical or acoustical device or instrument\ns. devoid of elaboration or diminution or concealment; bare and pure\ns. lacking any cover', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-4dc2fddce604bd9a', 'en', '英语扩展词汇（2001–3000）', 'anticipate', 'æn''tisipeit', 'vt. 预期, 占先, 加速, 提前使用\n[医] 提前出现, 先期发生', 'v. act in advance of; deal with ahead of time\nv. realize beforehand\nv. be excited or anxious about\nv. be a forerunner of or occur earlier than', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-85ae1763938de0e1', 'en', '英语扩展词汇（2001–3000）', 'nut', 'nʌt', 'n. 坚果, 核心, 螺帽\n[计] Novell NetWare服务器实用程序', 'n. usually large hard-shelled seed\nn. Egyptian goddess of the sky\nn. a small (usually square or hexagonal) metal block with internal screw thread to be fitted onto a bolt\nv. gather nuts', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-f98961015a0ac393', 'en', '英语扩展词汇（2001–3000）', 'extension', 'ik''stenʃәn', 'n. 延长, 扩充, 范围, 扩展名\na. 伸缩的\n[计] 扩展名, 扩充名', 'n. a mutually agreed delay in the date set for the completion of a job or payment of a debt\nn. act of expanding in scope; making more widely available\nn. an educational opportunity provided by colleges and universities to people who are not enrolled as regular students\nn. act of stretching or straightening out a flexed limb', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-3f3c58ae42b9b422', 'en', '英语扩展词汇（2001–3000）', 'battery', '''bætәri', 'n. 电池, 殴打\n[化] 蓄电池', 'n. group of guns or missile launchers operated together at one place\nn. a device that produces electricity; may have several primary or secondary cells arranged in parallel or series\nn. a collection of related things intended for use together\nn. a unit composed of the pitcher and catcher', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-7933e585a909e05b', 'en', '英语扩展词汇（2001–3000）', 'arrival', 'ә''raivl', 'n. 到达, 抵达, 到达者\n[经] 到达, 到达物', 'n. accomplishment of an objective\nn. the act of arriving at a certain place\nn. someone who arrives (or has arrived)', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-d0bf3889e9120514', 'en', '英语扩展词汇（2001–3000）', 'cope', 'kәup', 'vi. 竞争, 应付\nn. 长袍', 'n. a long cloak; worn by a priest or bishop on ceremonial occasions\nv. come to terms with', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-f41c19c580f7b5b2', 'en', '英语扩展词汇（2001–3000）', 'flame', 'fleim', 'n. 火焰, 火舌, 热情, 光辉\nvt. 焚烧, 用火焰给...灭菌, 用火焰传送(信号), 点燃, 激动\nvi. 燃烧, 爆发, 闪耀\n[计] 无聊邮件, 无益邮件', 'v. be in flames or aflame\nv. criticize harshly, usually via an electronic medium', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-10e0b8afcbb040e7', 'en', '英语扩展词汇（2001–3000）', 'wound', 'wu:nd', 'n. 创伤, 伤口, 伤疤, 伤害, 痛苦\nvt. 伤害, 损害, 使受伤\nvi. 打伤, 伤害\nwind的过去式和过去分词', 'n. an injury to living tissue (especially an injury involving a cut or break in the skin)\nn. a casualty to military personnel resulting from combat\nn. a figurative injury (to your feelings or pride)\nn. the act of inflicting a wound', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-80136de85bbef43d', 'en', '英语扩展词汇（2001–3000）', 'shower', '''ʃauә', 'n. 阵雨, 淋浴, 一阵, 展出者, 显示者\nvi. 淋浴, 下阵雨\nvt. 淋湿, 倾注', 'n. a plumbing fixture that sprays water over you\nn. washing yourself by standing upright under water sprayed from a nozzle\nn. a brief period of precipitation\nn. a sudden downpour (as of tears or sparks etc) likened to a rain shower', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-4c2f65997d3e1137', 'en', '英语扩展词汇（2001–3000）', 'garage', 'gә''rɑ:ʒ. ''gærɑ:ʒ', 'n. 车库, 汽车修理厂, 机库\nvt. 把车送入修车场', 'n. an outbuilding (or part of a building) for housing automobiles\nn. a repair shop where cars and trucks are serviced and repaired\nv. keep or store in a garage', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-3496ae539fd99f7f', 'en', '英语扩展词汇（2001–3000）', 'flesh', '''fleʃ', 'n. 肉, 肉体, 肉欲, 人性, 亲属, 人类, 众生, 人体\nvt. 以肉喂, 激起...的杀戳情绪, 使肥, 赋以血肉\nvi. 长胖', 'n. the soft tissue of the body of a vertebrate: mainly muscle tissue and fat\nv. remove adhering flesh from (hides) when preparing leather manufacture', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-86d3bfb618a7b1cd', 'en', '英语扩展词汇（2001–3000）', 'collapse', 'kә''læps', 'n. 崩溃, 倒塌, 虚脱\nvi. 倒塌, 崩溃, 瓦解\nvt. 使倒塌, 折叠\n[计] 折叠', 'n. an abrupt failure of function or complete physical exhaustion\nn. a natural event caused by something suddenly falling down or caving in\nv. break down, literally or metaphorically\nv. fold or close up', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-72cd0a82a0c7b084', 'en', '英语扩展词汇（2001–3000）', 'borrow', '''bɒrәu', 'vt. 借, 借入, 借用\nvi. 借\n[计] 借位; 借位数', 'v. get temporarily', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-3e56e6a43d0de25d', 'en', '英语扩展词汇（2001–3000）', 'comedy', '''kɒmidi', 'n. 喜剧, 有趣的事情', 'n. light and humorous drama with a happy ending', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-c803e426188665bb', 'en', '英语扩展词汇（2001–3000）', 'weekly', '''wi:kli', 'n. 周刊, 周报\na. 每周的, 一周一次的, 周刊的\nadv. 每周, 一周一次', 'n. a periodical that is published every week (or 52 issues per year)\ns. of or occurring every seven days', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-ee4dddc76b9d5e55', 'en', '英语扩展词汇（2001–3000）', 'grain', 'grein', 'n. 谷粒, 颗粒, 谷类, 纹理, 本质\nv. (使)成谷粒', 'n. a relatively small granular particle of a substance\nn. foodstuff prepared from the starchy grains of cereal grasses\nn. the side of leather from which the hair has been removed\nn. a weight unit used for pearls or diamonds: 50 mg or 1/4 carat', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-0f44510572409abb', 'en', '英语扩展词汇（2001–3000）', 'brush', 'brʌʃ', 'n. 刷子, 毛笔, 争吵\nvt. 刷\nvi. 擦过, 掠过\n[计] 电刷', 'n. a dense growth of bushes\nn. an implement that has hairs or bristles firmly set into a handle\nn. momentary contact\nn. conducts current between rotating and stationary parts of a generator or motor', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
