  ('en-ecdict-702b78f40c5a2ca9', 'en', '英语扩展词汇（2001–3000）', 'chase', 'tʃeis', 'n. 追求, 狩猎, 追逐\nvt. 追捕, 追逐, 雕刻, 在...上镶嵌宝石\nvi. 追赶, 奔跑', 'n. United States politician and jurist who served as chief justice of the United States Supreme Court (1808-1873)\nn. a rectangular metal frame used in letterpress printing to hold together the pages or columns of composed type that are printed at one time\nv. go after with the intent to catch\nv. pursue someone sexually or romantically', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
  ('en-ecdict-e56bb5acc77bdc54', 'en', '英语扩展词汇（2001–3000）', 'brick', 'brik', 'n. 砖块, 积木\na. 用砖做的\nvt. 用砖造, 用砖砌', 'n. rectangular block of clay baked by the sun or in a kiln; used as a building or paving material\nn. a good fellow; helpful and trustworthy', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
