  ('en-ecdict-5d7c6eae5b5bc575', 'en', '英语扩展词汇（2001–3000）', 'recording', 'ri''kɒ:diŋ', 'a. 记录的, 记录用的\nn. 录音', 'n. a signal that encodes something (e.g., picture or sound) that has been recorded\nn. the act of making a record (especially an audio record)\nn. a storage device on which information (sounds or images) have been recorded', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
