  ('en-ecdict-3da90bd3db535c44', 'en', '英语扩展词汇（2001–3000）', 'shine', 'ʃain', 'n. 光泽, 阳光\nvt. 使发光\nvi. 照耀, 发光, 发亮', 'v. emit light; be bright, as of the sun or a light\nv. be distinguished or eminent\nv. be clear and obvious\nv. throw or flash the light of (a lamp)', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
