  ('en-ecdict-f7c13f20cac709c9', 'en', '英语扩展词汇（2001–3000）', 'separation', '.sepә''reiʃәn', 'n. 分离, 分居, 缺口, 退职\n[化] 分离', 'n. the state of lacking unity\nn. coming apart\nn. sorting one thing from others\nn. the social act of separating or parting company', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
