  ('en-ecdict-e9dff3557ded7414', 'en', '英语扩展词汇（2001–3000）', 'sum', 'sʌm', 'n. 总数, 总和, 金额, 概要, 顶点\nvt. 总计, 概括\nvi. 合计\n[计] 系统实用程序和维护', 'n. a quantity of money\nn. a quantity obtained by the addition of a group of numbers\nn. the final aggregate\nn. the whole amount', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
