  ('en-ecdict-cdd97e00d3d88ff6', 'en', '英语扩展词汇（2001–3000）', 'crown', 'kraun', 'n. 王冠, 王权, 顶点\nvt. 使成王, 加冕, 居...之顶', 'n. the Crown (or the reigning monarch) as the symbol of the power and authority of a monarchy\nn. the part of a tooth above the gum that is covered with enamel\nn. a wreath or garland worn on the head to signify victory\nn. an ornamental jeweled headdress signifying sovereignty', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
