  ('en-ecdict-f3d78eaa2905e4b8', 'en', '英语扩展词汇（2001–3000）', 'disagreement', '.disә''gri:mәnt', 'n. 不合, 争论, 不一致\n[法] 不一致, 不同意, 陪审团的意见不一', 'n. a conflict of people''s opinions or actions or characters\nn. the speech act of disagreeing or arguing or disputing', '', '', '', 'licensed'),
